53128  * Scalar used as tolerance for iterative approach
53129  *===============================================================================
53130  Scalar
53131           epsilon                 convergence tolerance between two iterations  /2/
53132  ;
53133   
53134  Scalars
53135           interval_length length of each interval (hours) /0.25/
53136           optimization_length number of intervals in entire analysis /35040/
53137           operating_period_length number of intervals in each operating period (rolling solution window) /2920/
53138  *set operating period length to full year length (8760 or 8784) to do full-year optimization without rolling window
53139           look_ahead_length number of additional intervals to look past the current operating period /0/
53140   
53141           max_sys_output_cap output capacity of entire system (MW) /500/
53142           max_sys_input_cap  input capacity of entire system (MW)  /500/
53143   
53144           VOM_cost "variable O&M cost associated with selling electricity ($/MWh)" /0/
53145           reg_cost "variable costs associated with providing regulation ($/MW-h)" /0/
53146   
