404049  *generate an imperfect price forecast
404050  *elec_price_forecast(interval) = elec_price(interval) * uniform(0.95, 1.05);
404051   
404052  * Limit purchase and sale prices to the price_cap value
404053  elec_purchase_price(interval) = 1/1*(price_cap+elec_purchase_price(interval)-ABS(elec_purchase_price(interval)-price_cap))/2;
404054  elec_purchase_price_forecast(interval) = elec_purchase_price(interval)+nominal_penalty;
404055   
404056  elec_sale_price(interval) = 1/1*(price_cap+elec_sale_price(interval)-ABS(elec_sale_price(interval)-price_cap))/2;
404057  elec_sale_price_forecast(interval) = elec_sale_price(interval);
